# Force LF for every text file in this repository.
#
# This is a correctness requirement, not a style preference. The committed
# corpora under src/crucible/reference_data/ are hashed at runtime and that
# hash is written into run_manifest.reference_data[].sha256. If git rewrites
# those files to CRLF on checkout, the hash differs between a Windows checkout
# and a Linux one, two runs of the same version stop agreeing, and the
# reproducibility guarantee in CONTRACT.md §6 quietly stops holding.
#
# The same applies to the JSON Schemas emitted by `crucible schema --emit`.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.py    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.lock  text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Nothing in this repository is binary, so there is no exclusion list.
